&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 27px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 204px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;単元未満株式の買取り&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 444px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 12px"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 55px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 204px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 12px; text-align: left"&gt;取扱場所&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 444px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;（特別口座）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 24px; text-align: left"&gt;大阪市中央区北浜四丁目５番３３号　三井住友信託銀行株式会社　証券代行部&lt;/p&gt;
